OL,4,G1500FGilles Peterson
OL,5,     GGilles visits the legendary Dusty
OL,6,     GGroove record shop looking for
OL,7,     Gcheap bangers. Plus, words from
OL,8,     Giconic singer-songwriter and poet
OL,9,     GJill Scott about her first new
OL,10,     Galbum in a decade.
OL,11,G1800FThe Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,12,     FShow
OL,13,     GDetroit vocal trio Dames Brown
OL,14,     Gdrop by the show, following the
OL,15,     Grelease of their long-awaited
OL,16,     Gdebut album 'Take Me As I Am'.
OL,17,G2100FDon Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,18,     GDon's Saturday night selections
OL,19,     Gcross time, space and genre. He
OL,20,     Ghas culture clash curveballs from
OL,21,     GTrouble Funk, The Who, Sister
OL,22,     GNancy and Chinese American Bear.
